data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Confirmed: --font-size-3xl does not exist. I need to send the developer rework. But I should also consider whether I can accept it and just note it. The design explicitly says \"large, bold type size\" - this requirement is unmet because the token doesn't exist, so the size will be the browser default for h1. It might still look \"large\" because h1 default is large, but it's not using the design system as intended.\n\nI'll send it back with the exact failure. I also need to note that I already started the server - the orientation says start the server once after merging. I've started it. The server is running. When the developer fixes it and I fetch/merge, Vite will reload.\n\nBut wait - the dev server is running on my branch. If I send the developer rework, I need to wait for them. The server can stay running. Good.\n\nHowever, I also need to think about efficiency. There might be other issues. Let me check the AppShell/Header/Footer implementation - are they rendering data-component attributes? The qa brief mentions \"Each of its components renders a data-component attribute naming it, so look for that in the served page.\" Let me check the served HTML to see if Header/Footer/Button have data-component attributes. But the page is client-side rendered, so the initial HTML won't have them. I need to check with JS execution. I can use a headless browser.\n\nActually, the @codesweep-ai/ui components might render data-component attributes. Let me check the component source or d.ts. But the d.ts doesn't show data-component. The components are React components. I can inspect the JS bundle to see if they render data-component. Or I can use node with jsdom or puppeteer.\n\nLet me first send the rework for the font-size issue, since that's clearly a miss. While waiting, I can also verify other things. Actually, I should verify more before sending rework, to give the developer a complete list. Let me think about what else to check:\n\n1. AppShell, Header, Footer, Button from @codesweep-ai/ui - yes\n2. Buttons change colour via tokens - yes\n3. Greeting default teal - yes\n4. Header title \"Hello\" - yes\n5. Footer text - yes\n6. Server bound to 0.0.0.0:5173 - yes\n7. README - yes\n8. .gitignore - yes\n9. useState - yes\n10. Optional peers left out - yes\n11. Font size token - broken\n\nThe only issue I see is font-size-3xl. Let me also check whether the Header/Footer render data-component, but that's qa job. The design says \"Rendered in a large, bold type size\" - that's a design requirement, so it's my job to verify.\n\nI'll send rework."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789849217,"id":"chatcmpl-19fe1b2909aa45eb984054000973a502","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"# Rework: use a real design-system token for the greeting font size\\n\\nThe implementation is close, but one design requirement is not met.\\n\\n## Failure\\n\\nIn `src/App.jsx`, the greeting heading uses:\\n\\n```jsx\\nfontSize: 'var(--font-size-3xl)'\\n```\\n\\nThe `@codesweep-ai/ui` token set does **not** define `--font-size-3xl`. The available font-size tokens are:\\n\\n- `--font-size-xs`, `--font-size-sm`, `--font-size-md`, `--font-size-lg`, `--font-size-xl`\\n- `--font-size-prose-h1` (2rem), `--font-size-prose-h2` (1.5rem), etc.\\n- `--font-size-page-title`, `--font-size-section-title`, `--font-size-stat`\\n\\nBecause `--font-size-3xl` is undefined, the greeting does not actually get the \\\"large, bold type size\\\" specified in `DESIGN.md` via the design system; it falls back to the browser default for `\u003ch1\u003e`.\\n\\n## Fix required\\n\\nChange the greeting `fontSize` to a token that exists. Use `var(--font-size-prose-h1)` for a large heading.\\n\\nDo not change anything else. Keep the AppShell, Header, Footer, Button usage, the four colour tokens, the layout, and the state exactly as they are.\\n\\nCommit the fix and reply.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/tmp/dispatch-developer-rework.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_53","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789849217,"id":"chatcmpl-19fe1b2909aa45eb984054000973a502","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

